:su_01M82ABDR1CAX5PFZ2HWSEQHBF a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Some breeds are classified as dangerous by the local authority. Check the local list before you choose a breed." .

:su_01M82ABDR28HTPAFF4C44FRBZN a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Reward good behaviour immediately; ignore unwanted behaviour instead of shouting." .

:su_01M82APMQ68JDJRTYQDVNXFWWN a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An **indoor cat** never leaves the flat. On average it lives longer, but it needs more play and climbing places." .

:su_01M82B00WB34E68SXWEMVZ22ED a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Dogs may not relieve themselves in the inner yard or the flower beds. Dog owners take their dogs outside the building complex for this." .

